# BR CNPJ → POI Pipeline — Environment variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your API keys.
# .env is git-ignored and never committed.

# ── TomTom Search API ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used in Step 4 (geocoding), Phase C: re-geocodes POIs that got only a
# municipality-centroid match from BrasilAPI (low precision).
#
# Get a free key (2,500 req/day) or a paid plan at:
#   https://developer.tomtom.com/
#
# The free tier is sufficient for testing. For the full 3.75M POI run,
# estimate ~500K–800K TomTom calls (only the low-precision fallback records).
# That requires a paid plan or multiple keys rotated via a proxy.
#
TOMTOM_API_KEY=your_tomtom_api_key_here
